OL,3,CFire in a home caused by a mirror left
OL,4,Cnear a bedroom window
OL,6,FA fire in a home in Farnborough was
OL,7,Fcaused by a mirror left near a bedroom
OL,8,Fwindow, according to Hampshire and the
OL,9,FIsle of Wight Fire and Rescue Service.
OL,11,FCrews were called to the property on
OL,12,FSalisbury Road were smoke was seen
OL,13,Fcoming from a first-floor bedroom.
OL,15,FWearing breathing apparatus,
OL,16,Ffirefighters entered the property to
OL,17,Fextinguish the fire using hose reels,
OL,18,Fbefore clearing smoke, which had
OL,19,Fcaused significant damage to the
OL,20,Fbedroom, with ventilation fans.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
