OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786342684
OL,3,CFire in a home caused by a mirror left
OL,4,Cnear a bedroom window
OL,6,FThere were no casualties.
OL,8,FBefore leaving, firefighters checked
OL,9,Ffor signs of fire spread, and
OL,10,Fconducted a home fire safety visit
OL,11,Fwith the homeowners.
OL,13,FThe service believes sunlight
OL,14,Frefracting off a mirror onto a curtain
OL,15,Fsparked the fire.
OL,17,FIt's warning people not to leave any
OL,18,Fglass ornaments and mirrors near
OL,19,Fwindows, which could catch and magnify
OL,20,Fthe sun's rays and burn soft
OL,21,Ffurnishings.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/2
